    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17433" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὔλιον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>country-house, cottage,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				h.Merc.
				103
			</span></i>; <i>fold, stable,</i> etc., 
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				345
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				593
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				3.2.4
			</span></i>, etc.: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βοῦς ἐν
			αὐλίῳ</span> 'round peg in a square hole', <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				32
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>chamber, cave, grotto,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφιτρὴς αὔ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				954
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.334
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>).</div>
